      "text": "The methods should connect every HCI question to user data and analysis, specify collection tools and timing, and define permitted preregistration deviations and their recording. Use one exact participant target for sessions, staffing, payments, schedule, and budget—not a range—and disclose shortfalls with revisions. Distinguish prototype instability from design failure, prioritize institutional safety procedures over data collection when safety signals arise, and avoid treating feature lists as design contributions."
